{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b028ead0-d332-8fc6-8534-8e618459306a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:59:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Celeste Lopes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I'm calling about trash and recycling pickup. I'm at 255 Eustis Avenue, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 255 Eustis. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:57:46-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, um, I have the flyer here somewhere. Hold on. [pause] Okay. It says there's a changed schedule for the holiday week, but the part about which day we move to is cut off on my copy. I need the new schedule after the holiday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Is your regular pickup day Thursday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me see. Yes, Thursday. Trash and recycling both, it says, alternating."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. With the holiday that week, pickup slides back one day, so you'd be Friday. Then the week after that it goes back to normal Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Friday, then back to Thursday. Okay, let me write that down. Friday, then Thursday. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Was anything missed after the storm? A lot of routes got pushed around from the nor'easter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, ours wasn't picked up last week, and the storm ended Saturday so I figured it was the storm. I'd like a supervisor to call me back about that, if someone can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. I'll put in a request for a supervisor to call you. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0156."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one five six, perfect. They'll call you today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:58:59-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Oh, sorry, one unrelated thing. You have music on hold, right? There was a song on the radio this morning I can't place, and I thought I heard it in your line when I got put through. Never mind, probably not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I couldn't tell you, we get whatever the system plays. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Thank you. That's all I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:59:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye."
    }
  ],
